    ('Our premium client filed through their dedicated agent a $187,000 claim for water damage to their recently renovated basement home theater, but the contractor''s invoice predates the policy upgrade by only six days, and the plumber''s report indicates the burst pipe shows tool marks inconsistent with normal wear or freezing. The insured has also declined to provide access for a second inspection, citing scheduling conflicts three times in succession despite initially expressing urgency about the claim.', 'agent', 'premium'),
