    ('Our premium policyholder submitted an email claim for $187,000 in water damage to their recently renovated lakefront property, yet the independent adjuster noted the damage patterns are inconsistent with the described burst pipe, and neighbors reported seeing the homeowner removing high-value artwork and electronics from the residence two days before the alleged incident occurred. Additionally, the policyholder increased their coverage limits by 40% just six weeks prior to filing, and a review of their financial records reveals significant outstanding debts and a pending foreclosure notice.', 'email', 'premium'),
    ('Our premium policyholder submitted an email claim for $87,000 in water damage to their recently renovated basement, but the loss date coincides with the day after they doubled their coverage limits, and the independent plumber''s report indicates the pipe failure appears to have been manually induced rather than resulting from natural corrosion. The insured has also filed three similar water damage claims across two different carriers in the past four years, each occurring shortly after policy upgrades.', 'email', 'premium');
INSERT INTO {database}.{schema}.DEMO_CLAIMS_UNLABELED (CLAIM_SUMMARY, INCIDENT_CHANNEL, CUSTOMER_SEGMENT)
VALUES
    ('Our premium policyholder submitted an email claim for $87,000 in water damage to their recently renovated basement, but the loss date coincides with the day after they doubled their coverage limits, and the independent plumber''s report indicates the pipe failure appears to have been manually induced rather than resulting from natural corrosion. The insured has declined two scheduled inspection appointments and instead provided photos that metadata analysis shows were taken at a different residential address.', 'email', 'premium'),
    ('Our premium policyholder, Dr. Evelyn Marchetti, contacted us by phone regarding a multi-vehicle collision on Interstate 94 involving her 2024 Mercedes-Benz S-Class and three other vehicles, but the responding officer''s accident report was never filed with the county clerk''s office, and two of the other drivers'' insurance carriers are disputing liability while a third driver appears to have been uninsured. Dr. Marchetti is requesting expedited handling given the complexity of coordinating between four parties and the missing police documentation, which is critical to establishing fault allocation.', 'phone', 'premium'),
    ('Our premium policyholder, Dr. Evelyn Marchetti, submitted a detailed email regarding a four-vehicle chain-reaction collision on I-95 involving two commercial trucks from different carriers and an uninsured motorist, but the police report remains unavailable due to an ongoing state trooper investigation, and the third-party adjuster from one of the trucking companies has been unresponsive for over three weeks. Dr. Marchetti has provided dashcam footage and her own medical records from the resulting cervical spine injury, though we are still awaiting subrogation documentation and the secondary carrier''s liability acceptance before we can advance her claim.', 'email', 'premium'),
    ('Our premium policyholder, Dr. Evelyn Marchetti, submitted a detailed email regarding a four-vehicle chain-reaction collision on I-95 involving two commercial trucks from different carriers, but the police report number referenced in her correspondence does not match any filed incident in the state database, and the at-fault driver''s insurance company has yet to provide their policy declarations page despite three formal requests. Dr. Marchetti is requesting expedited handling given her longstanding account history and has noted that the original notarized witness statements were lost during transfer between the responding officer and the precinct records department.', 'email', 'premium'),
    ('Our premium policyholder, Dr. Evelyn Marchetti, submitted a detailed email regarding a four-vehicle chain-reaction collision on I-95 involving two commercial trucks from different carriers, but the police report remains unavailable due to an ongoing state trooper investigation, and the at-fault driver''s insurer has yet to confirm their policy limits. Dr. Marchetti''s dedicated claims advisor has been assigned to coordinate with all three opposing carriers while we proceed under her platinum uninsured/underinsured motorist endorsement pending receipt of the outstanding documentation.', 'email', 'premium'),
    ('Our premium policyholder, a commercial real estate developer, filed a web claim involving a collapsed retaining wall that damaged three adjacent properties, but the original engineering reports, subcontractor liability waivers, and municipal inspection certificates from the 2019 construction phase are missing from both the developer''s and the general contractor''s records. The insured is requesting expedited handling given ongoing litigation threats from two neighboring property owners and the municipality, while we await responses from four separate subcontractor insurers regarding their respective coverage obligations.', 'web', 'premium'),
    ('Our premium policyholder, a commercial real estate developer, filed a web claim involving a crane collapse at a multi-contractor construction site that damaged three adjacent properties, but the general contractor''s certificate of insurance, the subcontractor''s hold-harmless agreement, and the city-issued building permits have all gone missing following a recent office relocation. The insured is requesting expedited handling given pending litigation from two neighboring property owners and the municipality, and we are currently unable to verify coverage layers across four separate carriers without the missing documentation.', 'web', 'premium'),
    ('Our private banking client reported that during a weekend trip to their Lake Tahoe estate, the residence was broken into and approximately $340,000 worth of jewelry, fine art, and a rare vintage watch collection were stolen from a compromised home safe. The claim was filed through their dedicated personal lines agent, and local law enforcement has confirmed forced entry through a rear service door with surveillance footage currently under review.', 'agent', 'vip'),
    ('Our private banking client reported via email that a collection of rare first-edition books valued at approximately $185,000 was stolen from a locked display case in his home library during a sophisticated break-in while the family was attending a charity gala on the evening of March 8th. Security footage shows two individuals bypassing the alarm system through the basement utility panel and selectively targeting the book collection along with a vintage Cartier desk clock worth $12,500.', 'email', 'vip'),
    ('Our security camera footage shows an individual breaking into our detached garage on the evening of March 8th while we were away visiting family, taking approximately $4,200 worth of power tools, a mountain bike, and a portable generator. We discovered the break-in upon returning home two days later and filed a police report immediately before emailing this claim, as we just activated our homeowners policy three weeks ago after closing on the property.', 'email', 'new_customer'),
    ('Our security camera footage shows an individual breaking into our detached garage on the night of March 12th while we were away visiting family, and they took a riding lawn mower, a set of power tools, and two mountain bikes valued at approximately $4,800 total. We just started our homeowners policy three weeks ago and are submitting this claim along with the police report and photos of the damaged garage door lock.', 'email', 'new_customer'),
    ('Our security camera footage shows an individual breaking into our detached garage through a side window on the evening of March 14th, taking approximately $4,800 worth of power tools including a table saw, miter saw, and cordless drill set. I just started this policy three weeks ago and am submitting photos of the damaged window along with original purchase receipts for the stolen items.', 'email', 'new_customer'),
    ('Policyholder reported that their detached garage was broken into overnight on March 12th, with thieves stealing a riding lawn mower, a set of power tools, and two mountain bikes valued at approximately $4,800 total. The claim was filed through their local agent after the policyholder discovered the forced entry and filed a police report the following morning.', 'agent', 'standard'),
    ('Policyholder reported that their detached garage was broken into overnight on March 14th, with thieves stealing a riding lawn mower, a set of power tools, and two mountain bikes valued at approximately $4,800 total. The claim was filed through their local agent after the policyholder discovered the forced entry and filed a police report the following morning.', 'agent', 'standard'),
    ('Policyholder reported that their detached garage was broken into overnight on March 14th, with thieves stealing a riding lawn mower, a set of power tools, and two mountain bikes valued at approximately $4,800 total. The claim was filed through their local agent after the policyholder discovered the forced entry the following morning and obtained a police report.', 'agent', 'standard'),
    ('Policyholder reported that their detached garage was broken into overnight on March 14th, with thieves stealing a riding lawn mower, a set of power tools, and two mountain bikes valued at approximately $4,800 total. The claim was filed through their local agent after the policyholder discovered the forced entry the following morning and obtained a police report.', 'agent', 'standard'),
    ('Policyholder reported that their detached garage was broken into overnight on March 14th, with thieves stealing a riding lawn mower, a set of power tools, and two mountain bikes valued collectively at approximately $4,800. The claim was filed through their local agent after the policyholder discovered the forced entry upon leaving for work the following morning.', 'agent', 'standard'),
    ('Policyholder reported that their detached garage was broken into overnight on March 15th, with thieves stealing a riding lawn mower, a set of power tools, and two mountain bikes valued at approximately $4,800 total. The claim was filed through their local agent after the policyholder discovered the forced entry and filed a police report the following morning.', 'agent', 'standard'),
    ('Policyholder reported that their detached garage was broken into overnight on March 15th, with thieves stealing a riding lawn mower, a set of power tools, and two mountain bikes valued at approximately $4,800 total. The claim was filed through their local agent after the policyholder discovered the forced entry upon leaving for work the following morning and obtained a police report.', 'agent', 'standard'),
    ('Policyholder reported that their detached garage was broken into overnight on March 15th, with thieves stealing a riding lawn mower, a set of power tools, and two mountain bikes valued at approximately $4,800 total. The claim was filed through their local agent after the policyholder discovered the forced entry upon leaving for work the following morning and provided a copy of the police report.', 'agent', 'standard'),
    ('Policyholder reported that their detached garage was broken into overnight on March 15th, with thieves stealing a riding lawn mower, a set of power tools, and two mountain bikes valued at approximately $4,800 total. The claim was filed through their local agent after the policyholder discovered the forced entry upon leaving for work the following morning and provided a copy of the police report.', 'agent', 'standard'),
    ('Premium client called to report a complex liability claim involving a three-vehicle chain-reaction collision where the at-fault driver''s policy is held by a different carrier, and the rental car involved belongs to a fleet management company with its own separate coverage. The insured noted that the police report has not yet been finalized and the third party''s insurer has been unresponsive to requests for their declarations page, delaying subrogation efforts.', 'phone', 'premium'),
    ('Premium client called to report a complex liability claim involving a three-vehicle chain-reaction collision where the at-fault driver''s policy is held by a different carrier, and the rental car involved belongs to a fleet management company with its own separate coverage. The insured noted that the police report has not yet been finalized and the third party''s insurer has been unresponsive to requests for their declarations page, delaying the subrogation process.', 'phone', 'premium'),
    ('Premium client filed through their longtime agent a $187,000 claim for a complete home theater and wine cellar loss due to an alleged burst pipe, but the plumber''s report indicates only a minor fitting leak, and the client had quietly increased their personal property coverage limits by 300% just eleven weeks before the incident. The agent noted the claimant became evasive when asked to provide original purchase receipts and instead offered only handwritten inventory lists with round-number valuations.', 'agent', 'premium'),
    ('Premium client filed through their longtime agent a $187,000 claim for a complete home theater and wine cellar loss due to an alleged burst pipe, but the plumber''s report indicates only a minor fitting leak, and the client had quietly increased their personal property coverage limits by 300% just eleven weeks before the incident. The submitted inventory includes several high-end items with sequential serial numbers and receipts all dated within the same 48-hour purchasing window from an out-of-state retailer that has no record of the transactions.', 'agent', 'premium'),
    ('Premium client filed through their longtime agent a $187,000 claim for a complete home theater and wine cellar loss due to an alleged burst pipe, but the plumber''s report indicates only a minor fitting leak, and the client had quietly increased their personal property coverage limits by 300% just eleven weeks before the incident. The submitted inventory includes several high-end items with sequential serial numbers and receipts all dated within the same 48-hour purchasing window from an out-of-state retailer that has no record of the transactions.', 'agent', 'premium'),
    ('Premium client filed through their longtime agent a $187,000 claim for a complete home theater and wine cellar loss due to an alleged burst pipe, yet the plumber''s inspection report notes no evidence of water damage to surrounding structures, and the client had quietly increased their personal property coverage limits by 40% just eleven weeks prior to the reported incident.', 'agent', 'premium'),
    ('Premium client''s agent submitted a liability claim involving a four-vehicle chain-reaction collision on I-95, but the police report remains unavailable due to a jurisdictional dispute between state and county authorities, and two of the other drivers'' carriers have yet to acknowledge their insured''s involvement. The agent is requesting expedited handling given the client''s Platinum membership status and has noted that the at-fault party''s commercial fleet insurer is contesting coverage based on an alleged lapsed endorsement.', 'agent', 'premium'),
    ('Premium client''s agent submitted a liability claim involving a four-vehicle chain-reaction collision on I-95, but the police report remains unavailable due to a jurisdictional dispute between state and county authorities, and two of the other drivers'' carriers have yet to acknowledge their insured''s involvement. The agent is requesting expedited handling given the client''s Platinum membership status and has noted that the at-fault party''s commercial fleet insurer is contesting coverage based on an alleged lapsed endorsement.', 'agent', 'premium'),
    ('Premium client''s agent submitted a liability claim involving a four-vehicle chain-reaction collision on I-95, but the police report remains unavailable due to a jurisdictional dispute between state and county authorities, and two of the other drivers'' carriers have yet to acknowledge their insured''s involvement. The agent is requesting expedited handling given the client''s Platinum membership status and has noted that the at-fault party''s commercial fleet insurer is contesting coverage based on an alleged lapsed endorsement.', 'agent', 'premium'),
    ('Premium client''s agent submitted a liability claim involving a four-vehicle chain-reaction collision on I-95, but the police report remains unavailable due to a jurisdictional dispute between state and county authorities, and two of the other drivers'' insurance carriers have yet to respond to subrogation inquiries. The insured''s agent is requesting expedited processing given the client''s long-standing relationship and has flagged that the rental car reimbursement documentation from the third-party vendor was lost during their office system migration last month.', 'agent', 'premium'),
    ('Premium policyholder called to report a multi-vehicle collision involving four parties on Interstate 405, noting that the at-fault driver''s insurance carrier has been unresponsive for three weeks and the police report remains unavailable due to an administrative backlog at the county sheriff''s office. The insured is requesting that their dedicated claims concierge expedite subrogation proceedings and coordinate directly with all involved carriers while the outstanding documentation is being obtained.', 'phone', 'premium'),
    ('Premium policyholder called to report a multi-vehicle collision involving four parties on Interstate 85, but the responding officer''s accident report was never filed due to a departmental administrative error, and two of the other drivers'' insurance carriers are disputing liability while a third driver appears to have been operating under a commercial fleet policy with a different insurer than listed on the exchange of information form. The client is requesting expedited handling given their platinum membership status and has retained an attorney who is also awaiting the missing police report before proceeding with subrogation discussions.', 'phone', 'premium'),
    ('Premium policyholder called to report a total loss of a 2023 Mercedes-AMG GT allegedly stolen from a hotel valet in Miami, though the valet service has no record of the vehicle ever being checked in, and the claimant had increased comprehensive coverage limits just eleven days prior to the reported theft. The caller became evasive when asked for the hotel name and reservation confirmation, stating he would "need to get back to us" with those details.', 'phone', 'premium'),
    ('Premium policyholder called to report a total loss of a 2023 Mercedes-Benz GLE allegedly stolen from a hotel parking garage during a business trip, though surveillance footage shows the vehicle leaving the garage driven by someone matching the claimant''s description just hours before the reported theft, and the policy was upgraded to comprehensive coverage only eleven days prior. The claimant became evasive when asked for the hotel receipt and trip itinerary, stating he would need to "locate those documents" before abruptly ending the call.', 'phone', 'premium'),
    ('Premium policyholder called to report a total loss of a 2023 Mercedes-Benz GLE allegedly stolen from a hotel parking garage while on vacation in Miami, though surveillance footage from the hotel shows no vehicle matching that description entering the garage during the dates provided. The claimant became evasive when asked for the hotel reservation confirmation and rental car records, and a preliminary check revealed two similar theft claims filed with previous carriers within the last four years.', 'phone', 'premium'),
    ('Premium policyholder called to report that his $85,000 collection of rare wines was allegedly destroyed when his climate-controlled storage unit "malfunctioned" during a two-week European vacation, though the storage facility''s maintenance logs show no equipment failures and the claimant had quietly doubled his coverage limits just six weeks prior to the reported loss.', 'phone', 'premium'),
    ('Premium policyholder called to report that his recently appraised $47,000 watch collection was stolen from his home safe during a narrow two-hour window while the security system was conveniently undergoing a scheduled maintenance shutdown, though no signs of forced entry were found and the claimant could not explain how the thief knew the safe combination. The claimant has increased his personal property coverage limits three times in the past eight months and became notably evasive when asked about recent financial difficulties flagged during the initial review.', 'phone', 'premium'),
    ('Premium policyholder called to report that his recently appraised $47,000 watch collection was stolen from his home safe during a narrow two-hour window while the security system was conveniently undergoing a scheduled upgrade, though neighbors report no unusual activity and the policyholder had increased his coverage limits just three weeks prior to the alleged theft.', 'phone', 'premium'),
    ('Premium policyholder called to report that his recently appraised $47,000 watch collection was stolen from his home safe during a weekend getaway, though the security system shows no signs of forced entry or tampering and the claimant had increased his personal property coverage by 300% just six weeks prior to the alleged theft. The claimant became evasive when asked for receipts or photographs of the collection and insisted on an expedited settlement due to an upcoming international relocation.', 'phone', 'premium'),
    ('VIP client Mr. Harrington called to report a severe rotator cuff tear sustained when he slipped on an unmarked wet floor at the Four Seasons Hotel during a private corporate dinner event last Saturday evening. He has already consulted with an orthopedic surgeon who is recommending arthroscopic surgery, and he is requesting expedited handling of his claim given his upcoming international travel schedule.', 'phone', 'vip'),
    ('VIP client Mr. Harrington called to report a severe rotator cuff tear sustained when he slipped on an unmarked wet floor at the Four Seasons Hotel during a private corporate dinner event last Saturday evening. He has already consulted with an orthopedic surgeon who is recommending arthroscopic surgery, and he is requesting expedited handling of his claim given his upcoming international travel schedule.', 'phone', 'vip'),
    ('We recently purchased our home three months ago and are filing our first claim after a severe hailstorm on June 12th shattered two skylights and caused extensive water intrusion into the master bedroom and upstairs hallway, damaging the hardwood floors and ceiling drywall. I''ve emailed photos of the damage along with a preliminary estimate from a local contractor totaling $14,200 for repairs.', 'email', 'new_customer'),
    ('We recently purchased our home three months ago and are filing our first claim after a severe hailstorm on June 14th shattered two skylights and caused extensive water intrusion into the master bedroom and upstairs hallway, damaging the hardwood floors and ceiling drywall. I''ve emailed photos of the damage along with a preliminary estimate from a local contractor for $18,400 in repairs.', 'email', 'new_customer'),
    ('We recently purchased our home three months ago and are filing our first claim after a severe hailstorm on June 2nd caused extensive damage to the roof shingles, cracked two skylights, and dented the aluminum gutters along the entire north-facing side of the house. I''ve emailed photos of the damage along with the inspection report from our roofer estimating repairs at approximately $14,500.', 'email', 'new_customer'),
    ('We recently purchased our home three months ago and are filing our first claim after a severe hailstorm on June 2nd caused extensive damage to the roof shingles, cracked two skylights, and dented the aluminum gutters along the entire north-facing side of the house. I''ve emailed photos of the damage along with the inspection report from our roofer estimating repairs at approximately $14,500.', 'email', 'new_customer'),
    ('While I was away on a business trip, someone broke into my apartment through the fire escape window and stole my laptop, a gold watch inherited from my grandfather, and approximately $800 in cash I had set aside for rent. I discovered the break-in when I returned home Sunday evening and filed a police report immediately before submitting this claim through your website, as I just activated my renter''s insurance policy three weeks ago.', 'web', 'new_customer'),
    ('While I was away on a business trip, someone broke into my apartment through the fire escape window and stole my laptop, a gold watch inherited from my grandfather, and approximately $800 in cash I had set aside for rent. I discovered the break-in when I returned home on March 14th and immediately filed a police report before submitting this claim through your website.', 'web', 'new_customer'),
    ('While I was away on a business trip, someone broke into my apartment through the fire escape window and stole my laptop, gaming console, two designer watches, and approximately $400 in cash from my bedroom dresser. I discovered the break-in when I returned home three days later and have filed a police report, which I uploaded along with this claim through your online portal.', 'web', 'new_customer'),
    ('While I was away on a business trip, someone broke into my apartment through the fire escape window and stole my laptop, gaming console, two designer watches, and approximately $800 in cash I had set aside for rent. I discovered the break-in when I returned home three days later and have filed a police report, which I uploaded along with this claim through your website.', 'web', 'new_customer');
INSERT INTO {database}.{schema}.DEMO_CLAIMS_UNLABELED (CLAIM_SUMMARY, INCIDENT_CHANNEL, CUSTOMER_SEGMENT)
VALUES
    ('While attending a charity gala at the Ritz-Carlton, I slipped on a freshly mopped marble floor in the lobby restroom, resulting in a torn rotator cuff and fractured wrist that required surgical repair and six weeks of physical therapy. I am submitting this claim via email along with the surgical reports, hospital invoices totaling $47,200, and a statement from the hotel''s event coordinator confirming the lack of wet floor signage.', 'email', 'premium'),
    ('While attending a charity gala at the Ritz-Carlton, our long-standing premium policyholder slipped on a freshly mopped marble floor in the hotel lobby, sustaining a fractured wrist and torn rotator cuff requiring surgical repair. Her personal agent filed the claim on her behalf, noting she has also retained an orthopedic specialist for ongoing rehabilitation and is seeking coverage for all medical expenses, lost income from her consulting practice, and pain and suffering damages.', 'agent', 'premium'),
    ('While driving through a construction zone on Route 9, a loose piece of rebar punctured my front passenger tire and damaged the wheel rim, causing me to lose control and sideswipe a concrete barrier. I''m filing this claim for the tire replacement, rim repair, and body damage to the right side of my 2021 Hyundai Tucson.', 'phone', 'standard'),
    ('While hosting a charity gala at my estate, I slipped on a wet marble staircase in the grand foyer and fractured my left hip, requiring emergency surgery and an extended rehabilitation program that has forced me to cancel several international business engagements over the next three months. I submitted this claim through the online portal along with the surgical report from my orthopedic specialist and documentation of lost income from postponed board meetings and speaking commitments.', 'web', 'vip'),
    ('While hosting a charity gala at my estate, I slipped on a wet marble staircase in the grand foyer and fractured my left hip, requiring emergency surgery and an extended rehabilitation program that has forced me to cancel several international business engagements. I submitted this claim through your online portal and have attached the surgical reports from my private orthopedic specialist along with documentation of lost income from postponed board meetings and speaking engagements.', 'web', 'vip'),
    ('While hosting a charity gala at my residence on March 15th, I slipped on the wet marble staircase in the foyer and fractured my left hip, requiring emergency surgery and an extended rehabilitation program that has forced me to cancel several international business engagements. I am submitting this claim via email along with the surgical report from Dr. Whitfield at Cedar-Sinai, physical therapy documentation, and receipts for the private nursing care I have retained during my recovery at home.', 'email', 'premium'),
    ('While hosting a charity gala at my residence on March 15th, I slipped on the wet marble staircase in the foyer and fractured my left hip, requiring emergency surgery and an extended rehabilitation program that has forced me to cancel several international business engagements. I have forwarded via email the surgical reports from Dr. Whitfield at Cedar-Sinai, along with receipts for the private nursing care and physical therapy sessions currently underway at my home.', 'email', 'premium'),
    ('While hosting a charity gala at my residence, I slipped on the freshly polished marble staircase in the main foyer, resulting in a fractured left wrist and a torn rotator cuff requiring surgical repair. I submitted this claim through the online portal along with the emergency room records from St. Andrews Medical Center and the orthopedic surgeon''s recommended treatment plan.', 'web', 'premium'),
    ('While hosting a charity gala at my residence, I slipped on the freshly polished marble staircase in the main foyer, resulting in a fractured left wrist and a torn rotator cuff that required arthroscopic surgery. I am submitting this claim through the online portal along with my surgical records from Dr. Whitfield at Cedar-Sinai and receipts for the prescribed physical therapy sessions.', 'web', 'premium'),
    ('While hosting a charity gala at my residence, I slipped on the freshly polished marble staircase in the main foyer, resulting in a fractured left wrist and a torn rotator cuff that required arthroscopic surgery. I submitted this claim through the online portal along with the surgical report from Dr. Ellison at Cedar-Sinai and am requesting coverage for the procedure, physical therapy, and follow-up orthopedic consultations.', 'web', 'premium'),
    ('While hosting a charity gala at my residence, I slipped on the freshly polished marble staircase in the main foyer, resulting in a fractured left wrist and a torn rotator cuff that required arthroscopic surgery. I submitted this claim through the online portal along with the surgical report from my orthopedic specialist and documentation of the $47,000 in medical expenses incurred to date.', 'web', 'premium'),
    ('While hosting a charity gala at my residence, I slipped on the freshly polished marble staircase in the main foyer, resulting in a fractured left wrist and torn rotator cuff requiring surgical repair and an estimated twelve weeks of rehabilitation. I am submitting this claim through the online portal along with the emergency room records from St. Andrews Medical Center and the orthopedic surgeon''s treatment plan.', 'web', 'premium'),
    ('While hosting a charity gala at my residence, I slipped on the freshly polished marble staircase in the main foyer, resulting in a fractured left wrist and torn rotator cuff requiring surgical repair. I have uploaded photos of the staircase, the emergency room discharge papers, and the orthopedic surgeon''s recommended treatment plan through the online portal for your review.', 'web', 'premium'),
    ('While hosting a charity gala at my residence, I slipped on the freshly polished marble staircase in the main foyer, resulting in a fractured left wrist and torn rotator cuff that required arthroscopic surgery and six weeks of physical rehabilitation. I submitted this claim through the online portal along with the surgical report from Dr. Patel at Cedar-Sinai and all associated medical invoices totaling $47,800.', 'web', 'premium'),
    ('While hosting a charity gala at my residence, I slipped on the freshly polished marble staircase in the main foyer, resulting in a fractured left wrist and torn rotator cuff that required arthroscopic surgery and six weeks of physical therapy. I submitted this claim through the online portal along with the surgical report from Dr. Patel at Cedar-Sinai and all associated rehabilitation invoices totaling $47,800.', 'web', 'premium'),
    ('While merging onto the highway during evening rush hour, another vehicle abruptly changed lanes without signaling and sideswiped my 2021 Honda Accord, causing significant damage to the driver''s side doors and mirror. I submitted photos of the damage and a copy of the police report through the online claims portal.', 'web', 'standard'),
    ('While merging onto the highway during evening rush hour, another vehicle abruptly changed lanes without signaling and sideswiped my 2021 Honda Accord, causing significant damage to the driver''s side doors and mirror. I submitted photos of the damage and a copy of the police report through the online claims portal.', 'web', 'standard'),
    ('While merging onto the highway during evening rush hour, another vehicle abruptly changed lanes without signaling and sideswiped my 2021 Honda Accord, causing significant damage to the driver''s side doors and mirror. I submitted photos of the damage and a copy of the police report through the online claims portal.', 'web', 'standard'),
    ('While merging onto the highway during evening rush hour, another vehicle abruptly changed lanes without signaling and sideswiped my 2021 Honda Accord, causing significant damage to the driver''s side doors and mirror. I submitted photos of the damage and a copy of the police report through the online claims portal.', 'web', 'standard'),
    ('While merging onto the highway during evening rush hour, another vehicle changed lanes without signaling and sideswiped my 2021 Honda Accord, causing significant damage to the driver''s side doors and mirror. I submitted photos of the damage and a copy of the police report through the online claims portal for review.', 'web', 'standard'),
    ('While merging onto the highway during evening rush hour, another vehicle changed lanes without signaling and sideswiped my 2021 Honda Accord, causing significant damage to the driver''s side doors and mirror. I submitted photos of the damage and a copy of the police report through the online claims portal.', 'web', 'standard'),
    ('While merging onto the highway during evening rush hour, another vehicle changed lanes without signaling and struck the passenger side of my 2021 Honda Accord, causing significant door and fender damage. I am filing this claim through the web portal and have attached photos from the scene along with the other driver''s insurance information.', 'web', 'standard'),
    ('While merging onto the highway during morning rush hour, another vehicle abruptly changed lanes without signaling and sideswiped my 2021 Honda Accord, causing significant damage to the driver''s side doors and mirror. I reported the incident to my insurance agent the following day after obtaining the other driver''s information and a copy of the police report.', 'agent', 'standard'),
    ('While merging onto the highway during morning rush hour, another vehicle abruptly changed lanes without signaling and struck the passenger side of my 2019 Honda Accord, causing significant damage to the rear passenger door and quarter panel. I am submitting photos of the damage along with a copy of the police report filed at the scene.', 'email', 'standard'),
    ('While merging onto the highway during morning rush hour, another vehicle abruptly changed lanes without signaling and struck the passenger side of my 2019 Honda Accord, causing significant damage to the rear passenger door and quarter panel. I am submitting photos of the damage along with a copy of the police report filed at the scene.', 'email', 'standard'),
    ('While merging onto the highway during morning rush hour, another vehicle abruptly changed lanes without signaling and struck the passenger side of my 2021 Honda Accord, causing significant door and fender damage. I reported the incident to my agent the same afternoon, and a police report was filed at the scene confirming the other driver was at fault.', 'agent', 'standard'),
    ('While merging onto the highway during morning rush hour, another vehicle abruptly changed lanes without signaling and struck the passenger side of my 2021 Honda Accord, causing significant door and fender damage. I reported the incident to my agent the same afternoon, and a police report was filed at the scene confirming the other driver was at fault.', 'agent', 'standard'),
    ('While merging onto the highway during morning rush hour, another vehicle abruptly changed lanes without signaling and struck the passenger side of my 2021 Honda Accord, causing significant door and fender damage. I reported the incident to my agent the same afternoon, and a police report was filed at the scene confirming the other driver was at fault.', 'agent', 'standard'),
    ('While merging onto the highway during morning rush hour, another vehicle changed lanes abruptly and sideswiped my 2021 Honda Accord, causing significant damage to the driver''s side doors and mirror. I am submitting photos of the damage along with a copy of the police report filed at the scene, and I would like to begin the claims process for repair coverage.', 'email', 'standard'),
    ('While navigating a construction zone on Interstate 85 near Charlotte, a loose steel plate shifted under my 2024 Mercedes-Benz GLE 450, puncturing the oil pan and damaging the front suspension components, leaving the vehicle undrivable on the shoulder. I''ve uploaded dashcam footage and the tow receipt through the portal and would appreciate expedited handling given my Platinum policy coverage.', 'web', 'premium'),
    ('While on vacation in Myrtle Beach, the insured''s home was broken into through a forced rear sliding door, and thieves stole a 65-inch Samsung television, a Dell laptop, assorted jewelry valued at approximately $4,200, and a fireproof safe containing important documents and $800 in cash. The insured filed the claim online after returning home and discovering the break-in, and a police report has been submitted with case number 2024-07831.', 'web', 'standard'),
    ('While on vacation in Myrtle Beach, the insured''s home was broken into through a forced rear sliding door, and thieves stole a 65-inch Samsung television, a Dell laptop, assorted jewelry valued at approximately $4,800, and a fireproof safe containing important documents and $1,200 in cash. The claim was submitted online with an attached police report and photos of the damaged door and ransacked rooms.', 'web', 'standard'),
